=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  sysctl alpine ------------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net runs Alpine 3.23,$
# its values alpine323-vm's of 2026-11-14: six rows below the$
# baseline, eth0's redirects among them.$
$
# Kernel Settings ##############################################$
$
  [ ] Kernel               Review ~ 6 unset$
$
  Network ------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] ICMP redirects       1 accepted, hardn sets 0$
  [ ] IPv6 redirects       1 accepted, hardn sets 0$
  [+] Source routing       0 refused$
  [+] SYN cookies          1 on$
  [+] Broadcast pings      1 ignored$
  [+] Bogus ICMP errors    1 ignored$
  [ ] Sending redirects    1 on, hardn sets 0$
  [+] Reverse-path filter  1 strict$
   -  Forwarding           0 off$
$
  Kernel -------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] Kernel addresses     0 shown to users, hardn sets 1$
  [+] Kernel log           1 root only$
  [+] Address randomizing  2 full$
  [+] Process tracing      1 children only$
  [+] Unprivileged BPF     1 off$
  [+] Performance events   2 limited$
$
  Files --------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Hard links           1 protected$
  [+] Symbolic links       1 protected$
  [ ] FIFOs in /tmp        0 not protected, hardn sets 1$
  [ ] Files in /tmp        0 not protected, hardn sets 1$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Apply settings       Set 6 settings$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

